html: true
title: Ledger — a sortable expense table in Markdown
description: A real data table written as one Markdown file — clickable-header sorting, a live filter, running totals, and a light/dark toggle. Format pipes (| money, | date), aggregates (sum, avg, max), reactive sort, and :theme — all declarative, no hand-written JavaScript.
